{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jY_jTDszsuPBlJcqzCAkQw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.407147+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jY_jTDszsuPBlJcqzCAkQw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7fq1PibJgL0wnuibOtYPvicvIxFkVibYicuzicfHdjwPA0jlDDhKA3flfSnJ8w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7ffW24VGpHCqkicO0uNLcvt2BxeMqGkbabB9uG0q0icibmId5ZWDZtClaXQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7feLibt1Wjoic5yeYLl6ROgiaUK19ickd9ic5cicGECXCaEk2avhNMaDIK67vQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>电子工程与光电技术学院（简称电光学院）由创建于1953年的新中国军工科技最高学府——</span><span><span>中国人民解放军军事工程学院（简称哈军工)炮兵工程系的仪器科和雷达科演变而来。1960年中国人民解放军炮兵工程学院成立时，设立炮兵仪器工程系（四系）和炮兵雷达工程系（五系)，1962年两系合并成立炮兵仪器系（四系)。其后，根据学校隶属关系和学科专业调整变化，几经整合，于1992年10月组建成立电子工程与光电技术学院。经过六十多年的建设，学院形成了“敢为人先，争创一流”的学院精神和“团结协作、包容共生、和谐向上”的学院文化，提出了“多元化、国际化，国内一流研究型学院”的建设发展目标。</span></span><strong><span><span>学生培养校区为南京校区</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7fBcN9ibEcgjCG2vNjyCjKl3jGuOgLY2ibrpvlfz5doUPKKWTa4yAP3M4Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7fLVw4jUdaJMbjBmwGFc96qKoQjPqmmwN4qH3XFf4kE5H0sOEjrj27og/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>“国际化、多元化”办学特色</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7fjR5IibJLNITCC8SEjicZnSd1icqhEvIkicWBKsfZznzX4QPQZp8NzGOTCQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>电光学子勇夺第八届“互联网+”大赛全球总冠军（在苏高校首次）</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7fQoYibGduPffj3gEkb9S4EIoBF4EVGq0MuhqanFvw9arerZH7bicQTDSg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>电光学子多次获得高水平竞赛全国金奖</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7ffW24VGpHCqkicO0uNLcvt2BxeMqGkbabB9uG0q0icibmId5ZWDZtClaXQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>300人左右</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月10日-7月25日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业与本院招生专业相近，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力。学科竞赛、科研训练已取得优良成绩者优先；已获得与本院招生专业相近的学术成果者优先；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，由电光学院进行资格审核，通过邮件方式通知入选人员。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人需在2025年7月25日24:00前将申请材料（包括申请表、个人陈述、本科阶段成绩、英语水平证明及其他证明材料等）扫描合并为一个pdf，发至</span><strong><span><span>联系邮箱</span></span></strong><span>yz104@njust.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>开放日期间将组织政策宣讲、师生研讨、学科讲座等多种形式的活动。详细活动日程安排后续告知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：陈老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-84315431</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz104@njust.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>报名人员加QQ群：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRvOK9mB7RWjqxQoV5ibBs7fj8xZjuZ1bwfCiaNTVFMka5en